From: canoziia <canoziia@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] spec decode: adaptive DFlash verification depth

VLLM_GLM5_DFLASH_ADAPTIVE_K (default 0 = unchanged), with _DEPTHS, _ACCEPT,
_COSTS, _COSTS_MULTI, _HYST, _PRIOR, _LOG. The drafter drafts the deepest
depth; the scheduler verifies a load- and acceptance-chosen prefix; the
target captures uniform decode CUDA graphs per depth. Port of Morrowmake's
policy. Needs the V2 model runner and an explicit "method":"dflash".
Performance only; the output stays lossless.

